<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-26T12:56:39.717Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:56:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups in Nigeria's Niger state carried out a reprisal attack that killed at least 30 civilians and later deployed more tactical teams to the area, while separate assaults killed 11 soldiers in the southeast, 16 near the Malian border and 25 in another strike. Fulani communities suffered mass killings of at least 64 people, and a Saudi national was kidnapped by suspected Islamic State militants in Niger. Insurgents have begun using off-the-shelf drones, and rebels in Mali claim Ukrainian officers are training them on drone tactics, while a Russian envoy reports over 300 Russian soldiers killed in Mali. The Sahel jihadist insurgency caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUW5aeXpDUldIYjR5RlZ2bVdyUHFKZUtRcEUwTERNc3ZTRVFWTlNRSEZjV05VMVNyNG1KTXZNelVaQUJVaUlObUlqYXl5MV85b0hrTDdJMlA4YVcyanRXVVhrV19vUjBqRmR2WDBzcnY2MlFsTjdoS0paNGFTQWdESk5Lcm9GeWNSbUN6dkJwbDhwWk5WR1FqWXVWS1dYVjFVcElvNDd2RS11NnprbVVUdWl3cVVkVC16?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQVHZmV2MtaGtLcUNwZlhJQ3lGLVRRZGZqV2hQbWpSakFTUWk1OWd5NlNlYUo4OHJQWHhhYjhrUDhDNTV1N09ycEtSSHd5RU85ZW1JRnhkc2pUdHZfSzN6Q2xGRi1OVDZra1U4MDg4cGxKYmhhanUxQy1iYmNSRFhhdkJBSENLUkNBSmwwWFFGUkc2cl9rNkc4cWpUbU41RklXSWhIa1Jqemc2RmhoaDkxenNFalB3S0JPQ0VFR3l0TkpuR0o2VGYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxON0RjeHRWcGl1ZElENEhBX0x2blI3b2w1OC1vZ1U3SklwRTV5ajRTWVRXczVBTlBrN0JkQldfZEozLTU1b3AxUDJTM3dnX3FoTldYTmZVZWF3dW4xSFM0c2gtWS1yTWRvSmlsRDhMa1ZncXIybHVKaXlhZE9FSHNaanRCckd2RHA0cHVOVldWUmVKMGhUV1JUZG95amFmQ3oyWjBYNmZVSl80ZzhT?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;BarristerNG.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https